      "Each implemented lab gets its own README, source, tests and teardown",
      "Track candidates as planned until runnable code and validation exist"
    ],
    "outcome": "RESULT: an independently reproducible lab with clear expected outcome and cleanup",
    "validation": "PROVE: fresh environment succeeds · negative security test fails · resources removed"
